Package: FirnR
Title: Simulate Polar Snow and Firn Cores.
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(person("Thomas", "Laepple", email = "tlaepple@awi.de", role = c("aut", "cre")), person("Thomas", "Muench", email = "tmuench@awi.de", role = c("aut")))
Description: This R package provides tools for the simulation of polar snow and
    firn cores including their isotopic composition. Methods implemented include
    the depth-dependent simulation of firn temperature, density, diffusion
    length for stable water isotopologues, and isotopologue profiles based on
    the parameterization with the seasonal cycle in air temperature and a
    fraction of white noise.
Depends:
    R (>= 3.3.1)
